{"id": "33857", "title": "有种别逃", "author": "艾佟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 43, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33857.htm", "intro": "疑点一，人生三乐事之一，他乡遇故知，但这妮子看到他，不仅不乐还很热，冷汗直流、眼神飘移，一副作弊被抓到的样子，太奇怪了，如果印象没错，她以前还暗恋过他不是吗？疑点二，帅哥人人爱，多金更要拜，偏偏她逃得比别人还快，相约不是有事就是没空，他刻意安排的巧遇，她却像捉迷藏被鬼抓到一样，他难得动心的告白兼献吻，她的反应更是出乎意料，喂喂喂，我们没有在玩心脏病，把惊讶收起来好吗？ 疑点三，出来混，迟早是要还滴，老弟说看到一个「柯南版」的他，他还不信，看她一个大人买满满一袋的童书，他也没起疑，等亲眼看到「他」时，他只能说，猴～～抓到了吧，她不但「作弊」，还抄袭得一模一样……", "base": "files/article/html/33/33857", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2153625.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2153626.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2153627.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2153628.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2153629.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2153630.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2153631.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2153632.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2153633.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2153634.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2153635.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2153636.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2153637.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2153638.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2153639.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2153640.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2153641.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2153642.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2153643.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2153644.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2153645.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2153646.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2153647.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2153648.html